          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Petero tema, “Ee ca!” Ani elomuni Petero kai, kisyau Yesu akiŋit iŋes tema, “Anu itami iyoŋ Simoni? Neni ataŋae iriraata ŋirwosi ŋulu ka akwap ocur, neni a ŋituŋa a ŋulu ka akwap kec kori lotuŋa ŋulu erae ŋigelae?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
